     "replacement": "1. Draw a **cut** after the required place value.\n2. Circle the **critical digit**, the digit immediately after the cut.\n3. Decide whether to round up or down.\n  i. If the critical digit is less than 5, round down.\n  \n  ii. If the critical digit is 5 or more, round up.\n4. Round.\n  i. Rounding down: remove the digits after the cut.\n  \n  ii. Rounding up: add 1 to the digit before the cut, carrying to the left if necessary, then remove the digits after the cut. Keep every digit up to the cut, including final zeros.",
